+   "instructions": "Pull the fuel pump, its rubber mounts, the hoses and the float. Replace anything that has gone hard or soft. Use hose rated for submerged EFI use.",
+   "reason": "Old fuel kills the pump rubbers and hoses. These are the classic K-bike failures after storage.",
