+   "id": "X-BGS-01",
+   "phase": "E",
+   "after": "E-002",
+   "title": "Lube the drive splines",
+   "instructions": "Pull the rear drive and clean and grease the shaft splines with a moly paste. Look for oil in the swingarm.",
+   "reason": "Dry splines wear and fail. Most owners forget to grease them.",
+   "src": "Motoryk R1150GS notes",
